The {{Term/Store|Vah Naboris Divine Helm||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Vah Naboris Divine Helm is obtained by scanning the [[Urbosa]] [[amiibo]] with the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]].<ref name="YouTube"/> When worn, the Vah Naboris Divine Helm provides a basic level of both [[Guardian Resist Up]] and [[Shock Resistance]] and also allows Link to view an enemy's remaining health via the [[See Enemy HP]] effect.<ref name="Facebook"/> When paired with the [[Ancient Cuirass]] and the [[Ancient Greaves]] and each piece of [[Armor]] has been enhanced at least twice by a [[Great Fairy]], the three pieces of Armor provide [[Ancient Proficiency]], a [[Set Bonus]] that increases the damage dealt from the Ancient and Guardian archetypes of weapons.<ref name="Facebook"/>

The Vah Naboris Divine Helm is based on the head portion of [[Divine Beast Vah Naboris]], which Urbosa piloted as the [[Gerudo]] [[Champion]].

